WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.518
What the rings mean.

00:00:01.518 --> 00:00:07.512
Prevention covers reducing risk through a healthy lifestyle and regular checks.

00:00:07.512 --> 00:00:19.121
Activation means calling 995, following the dispatcher and arranging a nearby visible AED through another person; a lone rescuer stays with the casualty.

00:00:19.121 --> 00:00:26.481
Early CPR means starting promptly because brain cells can begin dying within four to six minutes.

00:00:26.481 --> 00:00:32.323
Early Defibrillation means applying a community AED and being ready to shock.

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:40.821
EMS and advanced hospital care continue treatment, and Recovery represents rehabilitation and community support.
